lti_row_url=N` (records whose URL text ⏎ appears in more than one row) and the receipts disclose it. The registry's pre-existing W04 ⏎ duplicate-URL warnings are census facts outside this claim. ⏎ 5. `bound` = records satisfying 1+2 (and rule C). `unbound` = records failing 1, 2, 3 or rule C. ⏎  ⏎ Predicate sentence, kill rule, counters and the 40/40/0 target are unchanged.]
